{
  "name": "Sword Saucer Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You are able to equip [Blade]. This skill is only effective when you are equipped with [Blade] in a [Hand Slot]. You can also equip a [Magic Stone] in a [Hand Slot].&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(SR2): Your [Evasion] and [Resistance] is increased by +1.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(SR3): Your [Physical Defense] is increased by + (INT Mod).</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A battle style that combines magic stones with a sword instead of a staff to activate magic. If you master it, you can acquire the power of defense that can stand on the front line even though it is a magic attack class.</p>",
